<title>USA: Biocircuits pregnancy test gets clearance.</title>
<headline>Biocircuits pregnancy test gets clearance.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biocircuits Corp said it received clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market its Qualitative Serum Pregnancy test.</p>
<p>The company said the test runs with a new and comparatively inexpensive diagnostic system, that greatly reduces doctors' expenses. It said U.S. doctors use about six million pregnancy tests annually.</p>
</text>
